fin-post-trade:CorporateActionDueBillTransferFulfillmentClosureShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "The corporate action due-bill transfer fulfillment closure is the sole PIT result for one exact obligation that closes the complete current transfer set, correction de-duplication, movement evidence, and fulfilled arithmetic and yields an unfulfilled, partial, or full result, used for settling the final fulfillment state of a due-bill obligation.";
