    sh:description "The corporate action schedule resolution is a unique-winner resolution that binds the evaluation input, event, request, applicability, schedule rule, and optional candidate assessment and yields resolved dates, entitlement pivot, and due-bill clauses, used for locking the key dates and entitlement scope of a corporate action.";
