    sh:description "The corporate action subscription obligation is a two-asset rights exercise obligation created once for a selected exercise, carrying the subscriber cash and securities accounts, subscription-agent endpoints, exact elected Quantity, and subscription Money, used for characterizing the cash and security delivery owed after a rights exercise.";
