fin-post-trade:ReconciliationMatchGroupShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "The reconciliation match group is an optional grouping of one or more internal projections and one or more external statement lines that are determined to represent the same logical business fact under a non-strict reconciliation profile, carrying the match cardinality and match basis. It admits one-to-one, one-to-many, many-to-one, and many-to-many matches that the Strict Technical Settlement Reconciliation Profile forbids in favor of one-to-one bucketing.";
